WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:02.400
Night, in a courtyard.

2
00:00:02.450 --> 00:00:06.530
Jesus has been arrested, and
Peter follows from a distance.

3
00:00:06.580 --> 00:00:09.880
Three times, Peter says
he does not know him.

4
00:00:09.930 --> 00:00:12.100
Then a rooster crows.

5
00:00:12.150 --> 00:00:15.420
Not long before, he had said
he was ready to go to prison,

6
00:00:15.470 --> 00:00:16.800
and to death.

7
00:00:16.850 --> 00:00:19.740
So why does Luke still make him a hero?

8
00:00:19.790 --> 00:00:23.970
In this mission, you'll follow Peter from
the fishing boat where Jesus first called

9
00:00:24.020 --> 00:00:24.660
him.

10
00:00:24.710 --> 00:00:28.220
Then you'll count the cost
Jesus asked of every follower:

11
00:00:28.270 --> 00:00:31.320
family, possessions, even life.

12
00:00:31.370 --> 00:00:35.410
Your mission: find out why
Luke still makes Peter a hero,

13
00:00:35.460 --> 00:00:37.070
even after his failure.
